# Data Directory (CBIS-DDSM)

Due to file size constraints, the raw medical imaging data is not included in this repository. You must download the dataset manually before running the pipeline.

## Download Instructions

1. Visit **The Cancer Imaging Archive (TCIA)**: [CBIS-DDSM Collection](https://www.cancerimagingarchive.net/collection/cbis-ddsm/).
2. Download the **Calcification** training and test subsets (both the images and the CSV description files).
3. Extract the downloaded files and place them directly into this `data/` directory.

## Required File Structure

Before running the notebooks, ensure your `data/` folder looks exactly like this:

data/
├── calc_case_description_train_set.csv
├── calc_case_description_test_set.csv
├── CBIS-DDSM/                 # The unzipped directory containing raw DICOM folders
└── README.md                  # This file
